# Render-time npm install only. `node render.js` is run after an explicit
# `npm i @fontsource/dm-serif-display @fontsource/manrope playwright@1`,
# so none of this belongs in the repo. Keeping it untracked made the
# stop hook ask for unapproved cards to be pushed every morning.
studio/node_modules/
studio/package.json
studio/package-lock.json

# Per-run scratch for the renderer. `cards.json` is rewritten every morning
# and `out/` holds cards that have NOT been approved yet. Approved cards are
# COPIED to the dated YYYY-MM-DD/ folder and committed from there, so neither
# of these paths should ever be tracked. The repo is public and its raw URLs
# are what Metricool serves: an untracked out/ made the stop hook ask, every
# morning, for unapproved cards to be pushed to live public URLs.
studio/cards.json
studio/out/
